    "body": "```\nSELECT * FROM (\nSELECT page, url, REGEXP_EXTRACT(LOWER(body), r'(<iframe(?:\\s[^>]*)?>[^<]*(?:<[^/]|</[^i]|</i[^f])[^>]+>)') AS match\nFROM [httparchive:har.2016_11_01_chrome_requests_bodies]\nWHERE page = url\n)\nWHERE match != \"null\"\nAND NOT REGEXP_MATCH(match, r'([\"\\'][\\),\\+]|\\\\[\"\\'/])') # markup in scripts\n```\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/zcorpan/0a507fce5497932a1fc7790afe920a27\n\n709 out of 165,162 pages (~0.4%). Of these, 422 have an `<a href>`, 94 have a `<script>`.\n",
